'''Bramblethorn Pass''' is a pass located in the eastern [[Stonetalon Mountains]], in the hills above [[Windshear Crag]] to the southeast. Here, the Bramblethorn quillboar have discovered a great evil, now retreating to the southern passageway to avoid the ghosts of their once kin on the upper cliffs.

